      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we are announcing the general availability of Amazon Textract Insights , a new generative AI feature of Amazon Textract available through a new API within Amazon Textract.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-amazon-textract-insights-verifiable-generative-ai-for-documents/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T20:22:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:57.794Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Amazon Textract Insights is built for reliable document processing, bringing this entire workflow into a single asynchronous request on Amazon Textract.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-amazon-textract-insights-verifiable-generative-ai-for-documents/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T20:22:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:57.794Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You then submit a single file of up to 3,000 pages from your own Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) bucket and enable splitting.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-amazon-textract-insights-verifiable-generative-ai-for-documents/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T20:22:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:57.794Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You create an Amazon Textract Insights project with the AWS public W-2, payslip, and bank statement blueprints, add a custom blueprint for loan officer notes, and enable splitting.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-amazon-textract-insights-verifiable-generative-ai-for-documents/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T20:22:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:57.794Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Amazon Textract Insights splits the file into its individual documents, matches each one to its blueprint, and writes the results to your S3 bucket.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-amazon-textract-insights-verifiable-generative-ai-for-documents/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T20:22:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:57.794Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We updated Amazon Textract’s reading engine , Amazon Textract Core, improving accuracy, strengthening the handling of dense tables and handwriting, and expanding language coverage to 40 languages for the DetectDocumentText and AnalyzeDocument APIs.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-amazon-textract-insights-verifiable-generative-ai-for-documents/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T20:22:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:57.794Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Amazon Textract Core is now generally available in two additional AWS Regions , Asia Pacific (Tokyo) and Europe (Zurich), bringing in-region processing to a total of 18 AWS Regions.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-amazon-textract-insights-verifiable-generative-ai-for-documents/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T20:22:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:57.794Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Amazon Textract Insights isn’t yet available in these AWS Regions.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-amazon-textract-insights-verifiable-generative-ai-for-documents/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T20:22:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:57.794Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Amazon Textract Insights reads documents from, and writes results to, the Amazon S3 buckets specified in your StartDocumentInsights request.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-amazon-textract-insights-verifiable-generative-ai-for-documents/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T20:22:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:57.794Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "If you disable your key or remove Amazon Textract’s access to it, Amazon Textract Insights can no longer use data encrypted under it.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-amazon-textract-insights-verifiable-generative-ai-for-documents/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
